WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:03.663
Two kinds of waiting, two ways to animate it.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.282
While data loads, show a looping animation.

3
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.383
When you know the progress, drive the animation with it.

4
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.993
The same player: autoplay for a loop, progress for a percentage.
